---
title: Maker Night — Things 4 Good
description: An evening for six. Buy one of six Golden Ticket candles at the fall sale and come pour four candles of your own, in any scents from our library. 100% to good.
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}

{# Off years (site.makerNight false): the page stays up but is unlinked and kept out of search. #}
{% block head %}{% if not site.makerNight %}<meta name="robots" content="noindex" />{% endif %}{% endblock %}

{% block navDate %}{% set seatsLeft = makerNightSeats.total - makerNightSeats.sold %}{{ site.makerNightDateShort }} &middot; {% if seatsLeft > 0 %}{{ seatsLeft }} {{ "seat" if seatsLeft == 1 else "seats" }} left{% else %}Sold out{% endif %}{% endblock %}
{% block navCta %}{% if makerNightSeats.sold < makerNightSeats.total %}<a class="btn btn--primary nav-cta" href="#reserve">Get a seat</a>{% else %}<a class="btn btn--primary nav-cta" href="#evening">See the evening</a>{% endif %}{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
{% set seatsLeft = makerNightSeats.total - makerNightSeats.sold %}
{% set seatsWord = "seat" if seatsLeft == 1 else "seats" %}

<!-- ============================ HERO ============================ -->
<section class="section section--ink hero" id="hero">
  <div class="hero-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy reveal">
      <a href="/" style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.4em;color:var(--marigold);font-weight:700;font-size:.9rem;text-decoration:none;margin-bottom:8px">&larr; Things 4 Good</a>
      <p class="eyebrow">{{ site.makerNightDate }} &middot; {{ site.makerNightTime }}</p>
      <h1 style="margin-top:18px">Maker <span class="pine" style="color:var(--marigold)">Night.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">We&rsquo;re trying something new! At the fall sale we&rsquo;ll have six Golden Ticket candles, each in a scent we made only for them. Buy one and you get a seat at Maker Night, where you&rsquo;ll pour four candles of your own in any scents from our library. It&rsquo;s an evening for six.</p>
      <div class="spots" role="img" aria-label="{% if seatsLeft > 0 %}{{ seatsLeft }} of {{ makerNightSeats.total }} seats left{% else %}Sold out{% endif %}">
        <span class="flames">{% for i in range(0, makerNightSeats.total) %}<span class="flame{% if i >= seatsLeft %} out{% endif %}"></span>{% endfor %}</span>
        <span class="stxt">{% if seatsLeft > 0 %}{{ seatsLeft }} of {{ makerNightSeats.total }} seats left{% else %}Sold out{% endif %}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-cta">
        {% if seatsLeft > 0 %}<a class="btn btn--primary" href="#reserve">How to get a seat <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#evening">How it works</a>{% else %}<a class="btn btn--primary" href="#evening">How it works <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></a>{% endif %}
      </div>
      <p class="hero-note">${{ site.makerNightDonation }} Golden Ticket candle at the sale, {{ site.saleDates | safe }} &middot; 100% to good</p>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-art reveal">
      <div class="tape" style="background:#1f1812;border-color:rgba(255,255,255,.16)">
        <span class="hand" style="color:var(--marigold)">one of six&hellip;</span>
        <small style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.6)">GOLDEN TICKET CANDLE</small>
      </div>
      <img class="ph" src="/images/maker-night.jpg" alt="A tray of lit wooden-wick candles glowing in the dark" style="object-fit:cover" />
      <div class="badge" style="background:var(--marigold);color:#2B2017" aria-hidden="true">
        {% if seatsLeft > 0 %}<b>{{ seatsLeft }}</b><span>{{ seatsWord }} left</span>{% else %}<b>0</b><span>sold out</span>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========================= HOW IT WORKS ========================= -->
<section class="section" id="evening">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h2 class="t">Buy a candle and you have a seat.</h2>
      <p class="lead">We&rsquo;ll have the wax, the wicks and everything else. We&rsquo;ve also already made most of the mistakes, so you don&rsquo;t have to. 😄</p>
    </div>
    <div class="steps">
      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="num">1</div>
        <h3>Buy a Golden Ticket candle</h3>
        <p>We&rsquo;ll have six Golden Ticket candles at the fall sale, {{ site.saleDates | safe }}, in a scent we made only for them. Each is a ${{ site.makerNightDonation }} donation. You take yours home that day and it&rsquo;s your seat.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step alt reveal">
        <div class="num">2</div>
        <h3>Come to Maker Night</h3>
        <p>Join us {{ site.makerNightDate }}, {{ site.makerNightTime }}, where a thank-you candle we poured for you ahead of time will be waiting.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step reveal">
        <div class="num">3</div>
        <h3>Pour your four</h3>
        <p>Pick any scents from our library, mix and match, and hand-pour four candles of your own with us guiding every step.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ====================== WHAT'S INCLUDED ====================== -->
<section class="section section--paper2" id="included">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">Included with your ${{ site.makerNightDonation }} donation</p>
      <h2 class="t">Six candles, all told.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="gifts">
      <div class="gift reveal">
        <img class="gift-label" src="/images/scents/golden-ticket.png" alt="Mazie’s hand-drawn Golden Ticket label" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
        <div class="big">1</div>
        <h3>Golden Ticket candle</h3>
        <p>Yours from the sale, in a scent made only for Maker Night. Only six exist.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gift alt reveal">
        <div class="big">1</div>
        <h3>A thank-you candle</h3>
        <p>Made for you ahead of time and waiting when you arrive on the night.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="gift reveal">
        <div class="big">4</div>
        <h3>Candles you poured</h3>
        <p>In the scents you choose. They need time to set, so pick them up whenever suits you.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========================= THE DETAILS ========================= -->
<section class="section" id="details">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">The details</p>
      <h2 class="t">Good to know.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="sale-grid">
      <div class="when-card reveal">
        <div class="glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <p class="eyebrow">When</p>
        <div style="font-family:var(--serif);font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.6rem);line-height:1.05;margin:14px 0 6px;position:relative;z-index:1">{{ site.makerNightDate | replace(", ", ",<br />", 1) | safe }}</div>
        <p class="when-note">{{ site.makerNightTime }}, one night only. The date is set, so check your calendar before you buy.</p>
        {% if seatsLeft > 0 %}<a class="btn btn--primary" style="margin-top:22px" href="#reserve">How to get a seat <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></a>{% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="info-card reveal">
        <div class="info-row">
          <div class="k">Donation</div>
          <div class="v"><b>${{ site.makerNightDonation }}</b> per seat, given when you buy your Golden Ticket candle. It&rsquo;s divided evenly across this year&rsquo;s four causes, and 100% goes to good.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
          <div class="k">Spots</div>
          <div class="v"><b>Six only{% if seatsLeft == 0 %}, all taken{% elif seatsLeft < makerNightSeats.total %}, {{ seatsLeft }} left{% endif %}.</b> We keep the night small and hands-on, so everyone gets real time at the pouring station.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
          <div class="k">Bring a friend</div>
          <div class="v">Buy two Golden Ticket candles and come together. Two is the most one person can buy.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-row">
          <div class="k">Where</div>
          <div class="v">Hosted by the Thingelstad family in Minneapolis. When you buy, we take your name, email and phone, and send the address before the night.</div>
        </div>
        {% if seatsLeft > 0 %}
        <div class="info-row">
          <div class="k">Can&rsquo;t make the sale?</div>
          <div class="v">{% if site.preorderSheet %}Preorder one on our <a href="{{ site.preorderSheet }}" data-tinylytics-event="preorder.sheet" data-tinylytics-event-value="maker-night-details" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--marigold-d);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">preorder form</a>; Maker Night is at the bottom. Jamie emails a payment link once it&rsquo;s confirmed.{% else %}Preorder one. Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" style="color:var(--marigold-d);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none">{{ site.email }}</a> and we&rsquo;ll set a Golden Ticket candle aside for you.{% endif %}</div>
        </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ========================= RESERVE ========================= -->
<section class="section section--pine subscribe" id="reserve">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow" style="justify-content:center">Seats</p>
    {% if seatsLeft > 0 %}
    <h2 class="t" style="max-width:28ch;margin-inline:auto">{% if seatsLeft == makerNightSeats.total %}Six Golden Tickets. Six seats.{% else %}{{ seatsLeft }} {{ seatsWord }} left.{% endif %}</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="margin:18px auto 0;text-align:center">Look for the Golden Ticket candles at the Things 4 Good sale, {{ site.saleDates | safe }}. Each is a ${{ site.makerNightDonation }} donation and a seat at Maker Night, {{ site.makerNightTime }} on {{ site.makerNightDate }}. First come, first served.</p>
    <div class="sub-form" style="max-width:none;gap:12px">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/#sale">See the sale details</a>
      {% if site.preorderSheet %}<a class="btn btn--ghost" href="{{ site.preorderSheet }}" data-tinylytics-event="preorder.sheet" data-tinylytics-event-value="maker-night-reserve" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Preorder online</a>{% else %}<a class="btn btn--ghost" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}?subject=Maker%20Night%20preorder">Preorder by email</a>{% endif %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <h2 class="t" style="max-width:20ch;margin-inline:auto">All six seats are taken.</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="margin:18px auto 0;text-align:center">Thank you to our six makers. See you {{ site.makerNightDate }}, {{ site.makerNightTime }}.</p>
    {% endif %}
    <p class="sub-note">Questions? Email <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}" style="color:#fff;font-weight:600">{{ site.email }}</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{% endblock %}
